              "user_message": "Here's how to cancel Netflix: Step 1: Go to netflix.com/cancelplan and sign in. Step 2: Click Cancel Membership. Open this link to jump straight there: https://www.netflix.com/cancelplan Once it's done, tell me the monthly amount you were paying and I'll log your savings."
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
